{"Title":"An Act designating a certain roundabout in the town of Orleans in honor of Dorofei Klimshuk","BillNumber":"H4484","DocketNumber":"HD4864","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"SKP1","Name":"Sarah K. Peake","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/SKP1","ResponseDate":"2024-02-05T13:07:20.73"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"SKP1","Name":"Sarah K. Peake","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/SKP1","ResponseDate":"2024-02-05T13:07:20.73"},{"Id":"JAC0","Name":"Julian Cyr","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JAC0","ResponseDate":"2024-02-05T13:07:20.73"}],"JointSponsor":{"Id":"JAC0","Name":"Julian Cyr","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JAC0","ResponseDate":"2024-02-05T13:07:20.73"},"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H4484/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Peake of Provincetown and Senator Cyr, a joint petition (subject to Joint Rule 12) of Sarah K. Peake and Julian Cyr that the roundabout at the intersection of state highways routes 28 and 39 in the town of Orleans shall be designated in honor of Dorofei Klimshuk.  Transportation.  [Local Approval Received.]","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1.  The roundabout at the intersection of state highway route 28 and state highway route 39 in the town of Orleans shall be designated in honor of Dorofei Klimshuk.  The Massachusetts department of transportation shall erect and maintain a sign with such dedication to be located along the frontage of 411 South Orleans Road immediately adjacent to the roundabout.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Suspend Rules","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H33","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/Genera